# Parity audit: Dialog (2026-11-12)

Reference: `spec/components/dialog/contract.md` + `contract.json` (status draft, 0.1.0).
Audited: `src/components/dialog/*` (8 elements, `context.ts`, `Dialog.scss`, stories), `playwright/tests/dialog/dialog.behavior.spec.ts` (47 `test(` calls, 53 cases with loops and story iterations), decision SB-0102 (and SB-0103 for the Command composition).
Method: read-only comparison of contract against code; `node harness/cli.mjs check` run. Tests were not re-run by this audit.

